# KASBench Environment Description

**Run ID:** ${run_id}

---

## Metadata

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Run ID | ${run_id} |
| Environment Profile | ${environment_profile} |
| AWS Region | ${aws_region} |
| Availability Zone | ${availability_zone} |
| Created At | ${timestamp} |
| OpenTofu Version | ${opentofu_version} |
| AWS Provider Version | ${aws_provider_version} |
| Git Commit Hash | ${git_commit_hash} |

