## Network

### VPC

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| VPC ID | ${vpc_id} |
| VPC CIDR | ${vpc_cidr} |

### Subnets

| Subnet | ID | CIDR |
|--------|----|------|
| Public | ${public_subnet_id} | ${public_subnet_cidr} |

### Gateways

| Gateway | ID |
|---------|----|
| Internet Gateway | ${igw_id} |

### Route Tables

| Route Table | ID |
|-------------|----|
%{ for name, id in route_table_ids ~}
| ${name} | ${id} |
%{ endfor ~}

